            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Radionuclide differences between ICRP Publication 38 and its succeeding work, ICPR Publication 107, are reviewed. The specific example of the isomer Nb is discussed, examining how dose reporting for this nuclide can be an issue.</AbstractText>
